 This directory contains the code and data files 
corresponding to example program #1 listed in 
chapter 2 (Getting Started) in the ADSP-2100 Family
Simulator Manual.

Build the architecture file:
bld21 example1

Assemble the program:
asm21 vectadd

link the files:
ld21 vectadd -a example1 -g -e vectadd

Invoke the simulator:
sim2101 -a example1
